{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":7,"docCount":22,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 性能优化 简介\n\n性能优化是前端工程中直接影响用户体验和商业价值的核心技术领域。研究表明，页面加载时间每增加一秒，转化率可能下降 7%，用户跳出率增加 11%。Google 将 Core Web Vitals 纳入搜索排名因素后，性能不再仅是技术指标，而是产品竞争力的关键维度。本手册系统性地覆盖了前端性能优化从度量到实践的完整知识体系，帮助工程师建立科学的性能优化思维框架。\n\n第一章**基础理论**从性能优化的底层认知出发。Core Web Vitals（LCP、INP、CLS）定义了以用户为中心的性能指标体系；浏览器渲染管线揭示了从 HTML 解析到像素绘制的完整流程；Chrome DevTools 和 Lighthouse 等度量工具则提供了数据驱动优化的基础——没有度量就没有优化，这是性能工程的第一原则。\n\n第二章**加载性能**聚焦于页面从请求到可交互的全链路优化。关键渲染路径的分析与优化、资源加载策略（preload/prefetch/preconnect）的合理运用、懒加载与预取的时机控制，以及图片和字体这两大静态资源的深度优化——加载性能决定了用户对应用的第一印象。\n\n第三章**运行时性能**深入 JavaScript 执行层面的优化。长任务的拆分与调度、DOM 操作的批量化处理、布局抖动的规避策略，以及内存泄漏的检测与治理——运行时性能直接决定了用户交互的流畅度。\n\n第四章**渲染性能**从框架层面探讨 UI 更新的效率。Virtual DOM 的 diff 算法原理、React 组件渲染优化策略（memo、useMemo、useCallback）、以及 CSS 动画与 GPU 加速的 60fps 流畅体验保障——现代前端框架在提升开发效率的同时，也引入了新的性能挑战。\n\n第五章**网络性能**优化数据传输的效率。HTTP 缓存策略的多层设计、Gzip/Brotli 压缩与 CDN 分发的组合应用、以及 API 请求的合并与优化——在网络条件多变的移动端场景下，网络性能优化尤为关键。\n\n第六章**构建时性能**从工具链维度优化产物质量。Bundle 体积分析与 Tree Shaking、构建速度优化与增量编译、依赖管理与按需引入——构建时的优化决定了生产环境代码的质量上限。\n\n第七章**监控与持续优化**将性能治理从一次性工作转变为持续化流程。真实用户监控（RUM）系统的搭建、性能预算的设定与自动化守护、以及性能回归的检测与告警——只有建立持续化的监控体系，性能优化才能真正落地并长期保持。\n\n性能优化的本质不是极端的技术追求，而是在用户体验、开发效率和维护成本之间寻找最佳平衡。本手册的目标是帮助你建立系统化的性能优化方法论，在面对任何性能问题时都能快速定位瓶颈、选择正确的优化策略并持续追踪优化效果。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-metrics-and-core-web-vitals","title":"性能指标与 Core Web Vitals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/foundations/performance-metrics-and-core-web-vitals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"browser-rendering-pipeline","title":"浏览器渲染管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/foundations/browser-rendering-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"measurement-and-profiling-tools","title":"度量与分析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/foundations/measurement-and-profiling-tools"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"loading-performance","title":"加载性能","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/loading-performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"critical-rendering-path","title":"关键渲染路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/loading-performance/critical-rendering-path"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-loading-strategies","title":"资源加载策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/loading-performance/resource-loading-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lazy-loading-and-prefetching","title":"懒加载与预取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/loading-performance/lazy-loading-and-prefetching"},{"seq":4,"slug":"image-and-font-optimization","title":"图片与字体优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/loading-performance/image-and-font-optimization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime-performance","title":"运行时性能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/runtime-performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"javascript-execution-optimization","title":"JavaScript 执行优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/runtime-performance/javascript-execution-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dom-and-layout-thrashing","title":"DOM 与布局抖动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/runtime-performance/dom-and-layout-thrashing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-management-and-leaks","title":"内存管理与泄漏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/runtime-performance/memory-management-and-leaks"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"rendering-performance","title":"渲染性能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/rendering-performance